Description: Tanita-compatible body composition analyzer reader
 Reads the measurements that body composition analyzers send over a serial
 port (RS-232 / USB) or Bluetooth, decodes them and stores them in a local
 database. Imports SD card files, exports measurements as CSV and prepares
 device reports for the developers. Includes a desktop interface and a
 command line tool, in Turkish and English.
